    "title": "Bobcats take convincing win over Banquete - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Coy Slavik ,\n1 days ago REFUGIO – The Refugio Bobcats celebrated homecoming on Friday, Sept. 25 with a 74-20 District 16-2A Division I rout of the Banquete Bulldogs at Jack Sportsman Bobcat Stadium. The victory lifted the Bobcats to 33 on the season and 1-1 in district play. Banquete fell to 1-4 and 0-2. Read full article",
